{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And they shall make an ark</b> — in all of them it is written ועשית, except for the ark, for which it is written ועשו, for all the vessels Solomon made like them, except for the ark. ארון — letters אורן, that in it is the אורן of Israel; and letters נורא, for it is consuming fire. ארון in gematria נזר, for the crown of Torah surpasses all crowns; therefore it is written ועשית עליו זר זהב, and concerning the table it is written ועשית לו — to teach that the crown of Torah surpasses the other crowns. אמתים וחצי ארכו ואמה וחצי רחבו ואמה וחצי קומתו — all its measurements were broken in half-cubits, to teach that everyone who studies Torah must break and humble himself." "<b>And they shall make an ark</b> — ten sections begin with making, corresponding to the ten utterances by which the world was created."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:22.175697756Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}